        <drink:preparation>Blend the yoghurt and ice cubes together, until the yoghurt becomes more liquid. Add sugar to taste. The lemon/lime is optional but it gives it a slightly tart taste. Dash of salt. Raita is also good for the summer. Instead of having a traditional salad you can make raita instead.</drink:preparation>
        <drink:servedIn rdf:resource="https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/glass/highball-glass"/>
        <drink:usesIngredient rdf:resource="https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/ingredient-amount/lassi-raita/1"/>
