        <schema:description>First: Mix pina colada with 2.5 oz. of rum with ice(set aside). Second: Mix daiquiri with 2.5 oz. of rum with ice. Third: While frozen, add pina colda mix then daiquiri mix in glass (Making sure they do not get mixed together).</schema:description>
        <schema:image rdf:resource="https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/qvuyqw1441208955.jpg"/>
